{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4c3c47bd36952fbce14a7a213547fcd00fbf78f8c740566c73a3d8f8d078c16b", "ja": "（定期公演の後、出演したメンバーが集まった。\nエレナの発案で、ピクニックとの事だが……）", "zh": "（定期公演结束后，参加演出的成员们聚到了一起。据说是艾蕾娜提议要去野餐，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "b9a6f7d08fb9753b2310d01871b53fec19d3725ce7d490e47d21b187ccbe0bad", "ja": "みんな、公演お疲れさまでしたー！\n今日は美味しいものたくさん食べてネ♪", "zh": "大家辛苦完成演出了——！\n今天要吃好多好吃的东西哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "5c001dff019dd9dcc66ae45bb9063fa1eaa6dd8b66cd1df30bb055789646454e", "ja": "これがエレナちゃん手作りの、ブラジル料理！\nすっごく美味しそう……！", "zh": "这是艾蕾娜亲手做的巴西料理！\n看起来超级好吃……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "0a57ba6dd6cb547f88955c663dcd06ae3294bef3acc13a4d04321514f6a18ada", "ja": "これは豆とお肉の煮込み料理、フェジョアーダだヨ。\nたくさんあるから、みんな遠慮しないでネ♪", "zh": "这是用豆子和肉炖成的料理，叫作费约阿达哦。准备了很多，大家别客气啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "cdd0516396338e6b27465971028ddb88309a6bcba63c4190ee8d72135b5bfca7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今日はお休みですよね？\nアルコールも用意してありますけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今天您休息对吧？\n虽然也准备了酒，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b54aa3781238f203d726c22b763600de3d5e888367377529429f6f97294a310f", "ja": "あっ、すみません！\nいいのかな、昼間から……。", "zh": "啊，不好意思！白天就喝酒，真的可以吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "f88c5a732939d00521ac3cb03ca0e91b2833383c5930bb4f79c1aaf0f61d45cd", "ja": "{$P$}、なんか嬉しそうなの。\n大人って、みんなお酒が好きだよね。", "zh": "{$P$}好像很开心。\n大人都喜欢喝酒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "68e297e2d948daf92c834d2a4fa25d5f7a9182d26e671a41975300c17cca14af", "ja": "かおり、お酒ってそんなにおいしいの？", "zh": "歌织，酒真的那么好喝吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "4314dfc4583548feab0cd9a8915d3be74f0b5a21219e0ead6189554e90101678", "ja": "そうね、環ちゃんにはまだ早いけど……\nでも、お料理の味付けに使ったりはするかしら。", "zh": "是啊，不过环还不能喝……\n但偶尔也会用来给料理调味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ce3ca0d3e65106a763594f3332b4fe3af640ed7586efe1074c4d406cd7f2dafa", "ja": "料理に使う時は、アルコール分を\n飛ばしてますからね……環、大人になったらな。", "zh": "做菜时，会把酒精挥发掉的……环，等你长大了再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "f1bfe220fa54f6c11ed6fd1bd6cca18ab505199f18de6f5433cb87b13fea2472", "ja": "うん！　ねえおやぶん、\n外でお弁当食べると、おいしいね！", "zh": "嗯！对了，大将，在外面吃便当，感觉真好吃啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7758033570330a6f12c179653254ff2995738b2af2c5d6b46fa4c7c302312491", "ja": "そうだな。……つい最近、\nお花見を盛大にやったような気もするけど……。", "zh": "是啊。……不过总觉得，前不久才热热闹闹地赏过花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "f6168436b0b49d42690b12769134070113824d162d0f41a6e7b152d657582d5f", "ja": "{$P$}、\nピクニックは何回やってもいいんだヨ？", "zh": "{$P$}，野餐不管来多少次都没关系哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "ca57f0290951f116432fc671ef973a0ba363f08c2d1967b22e516af5c1b74560", "ja": "天気が良くてポカポカで、いい気分なの。\nミキ、ずっとここにいたいの～……。", "zh": "天气这么好又暖洋洋的，感觉好舒服哦。\n美希想一直呆在这里～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "c02e49e721106783faf7aa7dd743ae23589ab641c32178a1ef95289f34140d9a", "ja": "あっ。美希ちゃん、こんなところで寝ちゃだめだよ！\n風邪ひいちゃう……！", "zh": "啊。美希，不能在这种地方睡着哦！\n会感冒的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1015_null", "source_sha256": "cd69907c5ae23276e0e78f03c8143789505a8a3fb6a39eeb841ecf808e8cb2a4", "ja": "帰り道……", "zh": "回家路上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0308118621ed946e4042ea39d59f9eeccccb7762fcdbc68f4e798264e70a3398", "ja": "エレナ、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "艾莲娜，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "a57bf7260865a6e53ff305989700793ac309888fe79dcd54398556e6e0c64dd7", "ja": "ううん。……{$P$}、\nこの前はありがとうネ。", "zh": "没事。……{$P$}，\n之前谢谢你啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "3a3e90b651b988d678bb676a45bcbd28a6a88848b0dbf5d412b99d75d3bedb79", "ja": "あの後、弟とママンがワタシに言ってくれたんだヨ。\n公演に呼んでくれてありがとうって。", "zh": "那之后，弟弟和妈妈对我说了：\n谢谢你邀请我们来看演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "65f88f3720c2004f0c4198daca1257d41cda7af2a22e6d1eab48f6b0f1ee37af", "ja": "エレナがみんなに、自分の言葉で、\nちゃんと気持ちを伝えようとしてるから……。", "zh": "因为艾蕾娜想用自己的话，把心情好好传达给大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "24a9f9e9a3080b374f50013886f4dd446d2d6923bc5abb2557fd3adbc4eaa7e7", "ja": "だからママンも、弟も……\nわかってほしいコト、がんばって話すって。", "zh": "所以妈妈和弟弟也……会努力把想让他们明白的事说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1022_p", "source_sha256": "85b06b3fccb2d62fc136875dbd610ae901799e5c9bd8991ca1bebf5499864786", "ja": "そうか……良かったな。\nさすが、エレナはすごいな！", "zh": "这样啊……那就太好了。\n不愧是艾蕾娜，真厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "9c8347aff2b0cba4f099f2ce0796f104622fdadbbdba84210a879e5d635bd90c", "ja": "エヘヘ……でもね、すごいのは\nワタシだけじゃないんだヨー。", "zh": "嘿嘿……不过呢，厉害的可不只是我一个人哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_128_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "b71a0b11d4de5114cb13f9ccb1062c5672ea0a99a7e2adace3cf6d86e6087e2f", "ja": "だって、ワタシをすごいワタシにしてくれたのは、\n{$P$}だから。ネっ♪", "zh": "因为，是{$P$}让我变成了了不起的我。对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
